{"type":"block","data":{"id":"achorestext2x10000000000000","parentId":"achorescard2000000000000000","rootId":"bchores00000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## What is needed\nFiles have been piling up in the folder for years. Make an inventory: what each is, which year it belongs to, what is duplicated.\n\nSuggest how to arrange them into folders and how to rename them — and do it once I say yes.\n\n## Important\nDelete nothing. Put anything unclear into «Sort out by hand» and say what exactly is unclear.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
