{"type":"block","data":{"id":"achorestext3x10000000000000","parentId":"achorescard3000000000000000","rootId":"bchores00000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## What is needed\nThere are statements in the folder. Collect the recurring charges from them: what for, how much, how often.\n\nWork out what that is per month and per year, and mark the ones I do not seem to use.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
